add_tr("err_need_cowplot", "Grafik için cowplot gerekli. Console: install.packages('cowplot')", "cowplot is required for this plot. Console: install.packages('cowplot')", "此图需要 cowplot。控制台: install.packages('cowplot')", "इस ग्राफ़ हेतु cowplot आवश्यक। Console: install.packages('cowplot')", "Se necesita cowplot para el gráfico. Consola: install.packages('cowplot')", "cowplot est requis pour ce graphique. Console : install.packages('cowplot')", "الرسم يتطلب cowplot. في الطرفية: install.packages('cowplot')", "এই গ্রাফের জন্য cowplot দরকার। Console: install.packages('cowplot')", "cowplot é necessário para o gráfico. Console: install.packages('cowplot')", "Для графика нужен cowplot. Консоль: install.packages('cowplot')", "گراف کے لیے cowplot درکار۔ Console: install.packages('cowplot')", "Für dieses Diagramm wird cowplot benötigt. Konsole: install.packages('cowplot')", "このグラフには cowplot が必要です。コンソール: install.packages('cowplot')", "이 그래프에는 cowplot이 필요합니다. 콘솔: install.packages('cowplot')", "Grafik ini memerlukan cowplot. Konsol: install.packages('cowplot')")
add_tr("err_need_ggpubr", "Grafik için ggpubr ve patchwork gerekli. Console: install.packages(c('ggpubr','patchwork','ragg'))", "ggpubr and patchwork are required for this plot. Console: install.packages(c('ggpubr','patchwork','ragg'))", "此图需要 ggpubr 与 patchwork。控制台: install.packages(c('ggpubr','patchwork','ragg'))", "इस ग्राफ़ हेतु ggpubr व patchwork आवश्यक। Console: install.packages(c('ggpubr','patchwork','ragg'))", "Se necesitan ggpubr y patchwork. Consola: install.packages(c('ggpubr','patchwork','ragg'))", "ggpubr et patchwork sont requis. Console : install.packages(c('ggpubr','patchwork','ragg'))", "الرسم يتطلب ggpubr و patchwork. في الطرفية: install.packages(c('ggpubr','patchwork','ragg'))", "এই গ্রাফের জন্য ggpubr ও patchwork দরকার। Console: install.packages(c('ggpubr','patchwork','ragg'))", "ggpubr e patchwork são necessários. Console: install.packages(c('ggpubr','patchwork','ragg'))", "Нужны ggpubr и patchwork. Консоль: install.packages(c('ggpubr','patchwork','ragg'))", "گراف کے لیے ggpubr اور patchwork درکار۔ Console: install.packages(c('ggpubr','patchwork','ragg'))", "ggpubr und patchwork werden benötigt. Konsole: install.packages(c('ggpubr','patchwork','ragg'))", "このグラフには ggpubr と patchwork が必要です。コンソール: install.packages(c('ggpubr','patchwork','ragg'))", "이 그래프에는 ggpubr과 patchwork가 필요합니다. 콘솔: install.packages(c('ggpubr','patchwork','ragg'))", "Grafik ini memerlukan ggpubr dan patchwork. Konsol: install.packages(c('ggpubr','patchwork','ragg'))")
